業驚傳有老婆「我們已結婚」　現任女友廖子妤也知情</p><p>「怪物新人」Andr首挑電影女主角　幻藍小熊采甄、蔡淑臻揭枉死真相</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T08:42:55.708613+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2270,"images":34,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T08:30:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T08:57:43.540071+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T08:37:43.476860+00:00","content_hash":"29db9d1797238868c2246ff8844e4954f620dd25be7f0405246331227bdfb942","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}